{"author":{"id":"3f8bad4585cb0f07c6570d9e31f06264af3b0abf48efbc5a44f56df5e7a9cd45"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1790454168,"nonce":"anSCqQQ40p7LaWZ8FDyj5k9MRO8=","message":"Revised with the user (2026-09-26): the project file names no roots and no modules. Modules of every language are discovered under the sources, src/ by convention (optional sources = [...] in [project]). A namespace mirrors its directory path, spelled as the path: src/game/ui/hud.wren is namespace game/ui, module hud. Wren imports it as import \"game/ui:hud\"; Haxe keeps its dotted package game.ui.hud.Hud. Every directory holding modules is a namespace, and namespace plus module is the file's path. Schema: [project] name, entry, languages = [...], optional sources; [dependencies.haxe] haxelibs, [dependencies.wren] hatch packages; [plugins]. A grammar-defined Zyntax language is listed by name and its .zyn discovered under the sources. Replaces the per-language [languages.\u003cname\u003e] roots tables and the first-directory-only namespaces.","files":null}]}